## Production Safety Features

| Feature | Implementation |
|---------|---------------|
| **Deterministic scoring** | No `random.choice()` anywhere — identical input → identical output |
| **AI timeout fallback** | Layer 3 catches exceptions, sets `ai_degraded_mode = True`, aggregator renormalises weights |
| **Default score on AI failure** | `NARRATIVE_DEFAULT_SCORE = 0.0` — conservative fallback |
| **Score reproducibility** | `STATISTICAL_SEED` in config, all baselines versioned via `BASELINE_VERSION` |
| **Config versioning** | `CONFIG_VERSION` embedded in every response — scores are traceable |
| **Privacy by architecture** | Layer 3 cannot receive unsanitised data; `raw` mode requires explicit opt-in |
| **No print statements** | All output through `logging` module |
| **No hardcoded thresholds** | Every number lives in `config.py` |
| **No circular imports** | Clean dependency graph: config → schemas → layers → aggregator → orchestrator |
| **No global mutable state** | All schemas frozen; orchestrator is stateless |
| **Immutable responses** | `FraudAssessmentResponse` uses `ConfigDict(frozen=True)` |
| **Audit compliance** | Every assessment logged with metadata; raw claim data never logged |
